<title>UGANDA: Ugandan shilling unchanged vs dollar, pound.</title>
<headline>Ugandan shilling unchanged vs dollar, pound.</headline>
<dateline>KAMPALA 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Ugandan shilling was unchanged against the dollar and pound in quiet trading, commercial bank dealers said.</p>
<p>The shilling was posted at an average rate of 1070 against the dollar while against the pound, it was posted at an average of 1730.</p>
</text>
